            "review_title": "Review at Cinéart Laforesta Cafe Bmt",
            "review_text": "CinéArt Laforesta Cafe BMT\n24 contributions\n0\nOne of the top 10 cafés you should visit at least once when coming to Buon Ma Thuot City, Dak Lak Province\nJul 2025 • Friends\nWelcome to Ciné Laforesta Café BMT, a hidden film‑set‐style café nestled just outside Buôn Ma Thuột city centre in Dak Lak. This lush, cinematic oasis is surrounded by nature—towering trees, verdant greenery, and beautifully curated décor—that transforms every corner into a picture‑perfect spot. With a spacious layout, both open‑air and cozy indoor areas, it's ideal for shooting photos, filming, or simply soaking up the tranquil atmosphere. Located conveniently near the city, Ciné Laforesta offers a diverse menu of refreshing beverages and snacks, all served with warm, friendly hospitality. Whether you're a coffee connoisseur, a content creator, or someone seeking peaceful moments, this café doubles as your own personal film set.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten July 10, 2025\nCinéArt Laforesta Cafe BMT\nCám ơn bạn đã ủng hộ quán, xin vui lòng giới thiệu thêm bạn bè đến ủng hộ quán bạn nhé!\nWritten July 14, 2025\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
